What does "Secure Network Services" mean?

This is the Oracle Net phase where the client and server negotiate Oracle Advanced Security features such as:

Native Network Encryption (NNE)
Crypto checksumming
Authentication services

So Wireshark is telling you that the client and server are performing Oracle Secure Network Services negotiation.
